to a theorem name. Separate kernel-check receipts, contract identities, assumption witnesses,
deployment bindings, and semantic-audit approvals. A missing receipt suspends current authorization;
it does not retroactively make an old kernel derivation logically false.

[INFERRED] The minimal record schema is: obligation `(claim ID, revision, context, target, instance)`;
candidate `(artifact, recipe, support versions, blocker IDs, cost receipt)`; finding
`(subject revision, candidate-or-obligation scope, evidence, disposition)`; and event
`(withdraw/assert/revise/check/select, input revision, output revision, residual obligations)`.
