# ACTIVITIES — lane log and handoff

## ACTIVITIES-1 (real 2026-10-20; LANG-66/67)

Scholar → deputized prototyper (Ember, confirmed to ROOT). Design: `redregg/work/ACTIVITIES-DESIGN-20261022.md`
