## Grounded worlds and first-class repair programs (rev 3)

[READ R:doc 1 §7; N:Lang/Proofs/Contextual/Stability.lean] The raw positive cycle `p←a, p←q, q←p` must lose p and q when a is withdrawn; immediate
support counts can keep them alive incorrectly. Nano proves grounded derivations and an unfounded-set result in a separate rule theory. The one-level
closure does not itself propagate theorem-to-theorem support or implement stable-model semantics. Its blocker literals refer to explicit token
liveness.

[READ R:doc 1 §7] The default cycle `p←not q, q←not p` has alternative stable worlds {p} and {q}; retaining both is not permission to assert their
union. No evidence either way, incompatible alternative worlds, conflicting evidence inside one world, and unfinished analysis are different states.
Differential update weights record removal, not logical negation.

[INFERRED] Give receipts a compatible world/revision identity and keep alternate assumption sets separate. Two candidates can safely coexist when
neither is asserted as the other's premise; composition must check that their supports can hold in the same world. In particular, do not use “no
audit failure found” as a default proof that an audit passed. The initial experiment can use explicit finite worlds and positive, well-founded
receipt derivations; it must label default-negation reasoning Outside this procedure until its semantics and implementation are supplied. Add a cycle
plant at the composed receipt layer, not only an unrelated toy cycle already known to fail counting.

[READ R:doc 1 §8] The algebra of checked repair asks for three separate results: conditional soundness, agreement with new-world analysis, and
locality. Recompute-everything satisfies the second. History-sensitive selection needs the same history on the reference side; multiple-solution
semantics compares admissible solution sets or another stated observation, not arbitrary proof identity. A first-class repair can be passed,
parameterized over edits/substitutions, composed, compared by policy, suspended with a residual, and checked independently of how it was found.

