does not say arbitrary premise withdrawal admits a transport; withdrawal supplies no witness for a deleted assumption, and representation changes may
require a relation rather than an equivalence.

[INFERRED] Retain a hint's source/target contract, matching substitution, transport lemma, and remaining side conditions. If an old proof of `P old`
